        listen("The new museum is, I suppose, impressive in its own way. The architecture certainly attracts attention, and the café is excellent. Whether anyone will remember the exhibitions themselves is, however, another matter entirely.", "Konuşanın müzeye karşı tutumu nedir?", ["Coşkulu ve hayran", "Karışık, biraz şüpheci", "Tamamen nötr"], 1, "\"I suppose\", \"another matter entirely\""),
        match([("sceptical", "şüpheci"), ("dismissive", "küçümseyen"), ("tentative", "temkinli"), ("resigned", "kabullenmiş"), ("enthusiastic", "coşkulu")], "Her tutum kelimesini anlamıyla eşleştirin."),
